  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FORGING PATHWAYS TO PEACE AND DEMOCRACY IN TURKEY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Forging Pathways to Peace and Democracy in Turkey project will organise a series of roundtable seminars, comparative study visits/events, mentoring and briefing sessions and assessments. Through activities, inclusive dialogue will be built around concrete arguments for the benefit of peace for all stakeholders in Turkey. These will consolidate the groundwork, knowledge base and motivation built over the previous projects for key stakeholders and policymakers in Turkey to move the peace process onto their agendas.</narrative>
  </description>
